packages/ai/README.md:1285:**OpenAI Codex**: Requires a ChatGPT Plus or Pro subscription. Provides access to GPT-5.x Codex models with extended context windows and reasoning capabilities. The library automatically handles session-based prompt caching when `sessionId` is provided in stream options. You can set `transport` in stream options to `"sse"`, `"websocket"`, or `"auto"` for Codex Responses transport selection. When using WebSocket with a `sessionId`, connections are reused per session and expire after 5 minutes of inactivity.
